Talk about your family in French 👨‍👩‍👧🇫🇷 (it's easier than you think)

• un frère = a brother
• une sœur = a sister
• fils unique = only child (son)
• quel âge ? = how old?
• bruyant = noisy

💌 Save this for your next French chat
👯 Send it to a friend who has a big family

